13	/**
14	 * Emits an audit line on the dedicated {@code AUDIT} logger after a successful create,
15	 * carrying the newly-assigned owner id, its memberId, its registrationDate and its
16	 * numeric membershipLevel. Runs after {@code save}, so the owner's generated id is
17	 * available. The logged level is the household-capped one, so it matches what the response
18	 * and later reads return.
19	 *
20	 * <p>Alongside the human-readable line, emits an immutable structured event on the same
21	 * {@code AUDIT} logger. The event is now schema version 2: a JSON object
22	 * {@code {seq, schemaVersion:2, ownerId, memberId, membershipLevel, event:'OWNER_CREATED'}} where
23	 * {@code seq} is a monotonically increasing integer across creates. The event carries the
24	 * owner's primary identifier via {@link #primaryIdentifier(Owner)} — the version-2 memberId.
25	 */
26	public class AuditOwnerCreated {
27	
28	    private static final Logger AUDIT = LoggerFactory.getLogger("AUDIT");
29	
30	    /** Monotonically increasing sequence across all creates in this instance. */
